        "b2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vänt started in the USA with one simple idea: an upholstered headboard wall that looks made-to-measure, costs far less and goes up in an afternoon. Vänt panels have featured on HGTV, Netflix’s Queer Eye and DIY Network.</p><p>Vänt UK brings the full range to the UK and Europe. We’re the official distributor, run from London, with a UK team you can call and stock that’s dispatched the next working day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
